*PAR:	occupying the extreme north^east corner Friuli's scenery ranges from rugged coastline along the eastern border to placid plains in the west and the majestic Alps in the north where Italy butts up against Australia . 34355_49035
*PAR:	directly to the south is Venice just a little more than an hour and a half away . 50565_55205
*PAR:	though off the beaten tourist [/] tourist track Friuli <is hard> [/] is hard in the path of history . 55813_63065
